# RT-qPCR 多靶点相对定量实验（96 孔多维复孔，AsterML v2）

```asterlab
kind: experiment
id: exp-rtqpcr-v2
schema: 1
title: RT-qPCR 多靶点相对定量实验
objective: 比较 VEGF 诱导与抑制剂干预后 VEGFA、CD31 与内参 GAPDH 的相对表达变化（2^-ddCt），在同一 96 孔板管理生物样本、技术三复孔与 Std/NTC 对照。
experimental_unit: 96 孔板单孔
primary_endpoint: Ct
endpoint_method: SYBR Green 两步法荧光定量 PCR
endpoint_unit: "1"
```

```asterlab
kind: group_table
id: gt-rtqpcr
schema: 1
title: qPCR 实验分组
rows:
  - id: group-control
    name: 对照组
    role: control
    condition: 无处理 cDNA 对照
    independent_n: 3
    technical_repeats: 3
  - id: group-vegf
    name: VEGF 诱导组
    role: treatment
    dose: 50 ng/mL
    condition: VEGF 50 ng/mL 处理 24 h
    independent_n: 3
    technical_repeats: 3
  - id: group-drug
    name: 抑制剂干预组
    role: treatment
    dose: 50 ng/mL + 500 ug/mL
    condition: VEGF 50 ng/mL + 抑制剂共孵育
    independent_n: 3
    technical_repeats: 3
  - id: group-qc
    name: 质控参照（Std / NTC）
    role: reference
    condition: 梯度标准品与无模板阴性对照
    independent_n: 2
    technical_repeats: 3
```

```asterlab
kind: material
id: mat-sybr
schema: 1
name: SYBR Green MasterMix (2×)
role: treatment
condition: qPCR pre-mix
concentration:
  value: 2
  unit: mg/mL
source: built_in
```

```asterlab
kind: assay
id: assay-qpcr
schema: 1
title: SYBR qPCR 多靶点测定
endpoint: Ct
unit: "1"
group_refs: [group-control, group-vegf, group-drug, group-qc]
timepoints: [40_cycles]
```

```asterlab
